mn2:12.10 starts: While taints, vexation, and fever might arise
mn104:14.8 starts: by removal of litigation by confrontation.
mn104:15.8 starts: by the opinion of a majority.
mn104:18.11 starts: by the effecting of acknowledgement of an offence.
mn104:19.24 starts: by the pronouncement of bad character against someone.
